# Autonomy policy

This file is owner controlled and is only injected when the optional
`autonomy-context` feature is enabled.

## Green actions

Small, local and reversible changes inside this instance may be completed and
reported afterwards.

## Yellow actions

Visible or durable but reversible changes require a short explanation and a
specific undo instruction after completion.

## Red actions

Always ask before purchases, messages to other people, destructive actions,
credential or access changes, physical-safety actions, provider/runtime
installation, or anything billed per API call.

The hard safety rules in AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md always take precedence.
